},{"postID":74958,"threadID":5035,"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","subject":"","time":1515006643,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2511,"username":"Xlaer","time":1515008258,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Glückwunsch ma dude</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74959,"threadID":5035,"userID":2576,"username":"TimeShot","subject":"","time":1515006659,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2587,"username":"boy","time":1515006751,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Die einzige Möglichkeit von einem Supporter zu einem Test-Admin zu werden, ist, überdurchschnittliche Leistungen zu erbringen. Sollte dies der Fall sein, ist es nach einer erneuten Bewerbung und Gespräch möglich, als Test-Admin tätig zu werden.</p></blockquote><p>Wo ist die Bewerbung? habe ich da was verpasst?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74960,"threadID":5035,"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","subject":"","time":1515006739,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2511,"username":"Xlaer","time":1515009179,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>gw</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74961,"threadID":5035,"userID":2587,"username":"boy","subject":"","time":1515006745,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1515006767,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>TimeShot</strong></cite><p>Wo ist die Bewerbung? habe ich da was verpasst?</p>\n</blockquote><p>geht auch ohne wie du siehst <br></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74962,"threadID":5035,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"","time":1515006806,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>TimeShot</strong></cite><p>Wo ist die Bewerbung? habe ich da was verpasst?</p>\n</blockquote><p>Wir haben uns darauf festgelegt, die Bewerbung intern erfolgen zu lassen &amp; den Fokus auf das Gespräch zu legen. Schließlich wäre die Bewerbung in den meisten Fällen die gleiche wie zum Supporter nur &quot;ausgefüllter&quot;, wobei sich die Frage stellt, ob das dann noch interessant zu lesen ist.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74964,"threadID":5035,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1515007073,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2511,"username":"Xlaer","time":1515009196,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Congratulations dude, deserved.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74965,"threadID":5035,"userID":2547,"username":"Perks","subject":"","time":1515007447,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2511,"username":"Xlaer","time":1515009198,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Herzlichen Glückwunsch. Hast du auf jeden Fall verdient.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":74966,"threadID":5035,"userID":1543,"username":"Weltraum Spion","subject":"","time":1515009962,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>HGW. <span class=\"mention\">@Xlaer</span></p>","polls":[]}]}